<title>MALAYSIA: Table of Malaysia's trade figures for April.</title>
<headline>Table of Malaysia's trade figures for April.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following table gives Malaysia's monthly trade figures after the government announced a 2.1 billion ringgit deficit in April.</p>
<p>	   MALAYSIA TRADE BALANCE</p>
<p>	   (in billions of ringgit)</p>
<p>			April 1997	    March 1997</p>
<p>Trade balance	  -2.1		    1.75</p>
<p>Exports		  15.7		    18.68</p>
<p>Imports		  17.8		    16.93</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
